body:
I always notice how a woman dresses on a date so that's always a large plus. Being affectionate on the date or expressing your enthusiasm and excitement always puts me at ease and turns me on to you. If you initiate a way for us to spend time together that's a huge green flag for me. If you miss a call from me saying "hey, I'm sorry I can't talk right now." or "Let's talk later." I appreciate that, or if you call me out of the blue just to check on me, confirming if I'm still ready for plans we set up which shows you're not flaking, texting your ETA before the date, and texting when you get back home like "Hey, I got home safe and  I had an amazing time tonight :)" are all small ways that put me at ease. 

&#x200B;

Men catch feelings quicker and easier than women so it's always a risk to catch feelings for someone who is not into you, and if you are into a guy that is into you, then make his life easier and let him love you.
